                <div class="pg-card">
                    <h3 class="pgx-12">Sellers using a 3PL or warehouse</h3>
                    <p class="pg-card__desc">Your logistics partner needs to see your orders, acknowledge them, and update tracking. Ecom Circles connects the same order data to your warehouse so handoffs stop being email threads.</p>
                </div>
